; exclude_spin_model_index_out_of_range: on a spin model, NonBinaryModel comes
; before the index check.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md raises NonBinaryModel right after the model type check and
; before any index or operand check against the model. Index 9 is outside the
; 4-variable model, so this program would raise IndexOutOfBounds on a binary
; model; on a spin model the domain check runs first.

PUSH 4
SQMX r0          ; spin model, 4 variables
PUSH 0           ; i
PUSH 9           ; j, out of range
PUSH 5           ; penalty
EXCLUDE r0
HALT
